{"version":1,"content":"<p>在2026年Ignite大會上，微軟明確表示將繼續投入WinUI，不會放棄這一框架，也不會用其他框架取代它。微軟還以Windows 11重新設計的「運行」對話框為例，説明WinUI近期取得的進展，並希望更多開發者採用這一原生應用框架。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588144.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.863205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:06:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"9c9cec3b092f25ce9b33e14c0d1d71626e69dec252339f5a22df2178328ccfa5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}